msgid ""
"You can also embed small pieces of documentation in the ROM of the chip that"
" are readable when examining the @ROMFS folder via MAVFtp. These can be "
"pictures or small informational documents. These must fit within the free "
"flash space of the autopilot. These files can be located in sub-directories "
"in ``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange`` (e.g. "
"``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange/AircraftManual``)."
msgstr ""
"你还可以在芯片的 ROM 中嵌入少量文档，通过 MAVFtp 查看 @ROMFS "
"文件夹时即可读取。这些可以是图片或小型说明文档，且必须能放入飞控的空闲闪存空间。这些文件可以放在 "
"``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange`` 的子目录中（例如 "
"``libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/OEM_CubeOrange/AircraftManual``）。"
